    "name": "Mech Havoc",
    "steam_appid": 3237920,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/8722320292869042981e2568e44c2709.webp?t=1750927811\" width=600 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/a81220112cd4fbbc1219f988efa9d164.poster.avif?t=1750927811\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/a81220112cd4fbbc1219f988efa9d164.webm?t=1750927811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/a81220112cd4fbbc1219f988efa9d164.mp4?t=1750927811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>Evil AI</strong> called <strong>HIVE</strong> has gained sentience and conquered Planet-X! Now it's up to you to <strong>FIGHT BACK</strong> using a large range of vehicles. From a small and quick <strong>Weaponized Delivery Truck</strong> all the way to building sized <strong>Heavy Mechs</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new Vehicles and Weapons</strong> by completing missions and fighting against the ever-increasing threat of hostile machines. <strong>Equip Your Vehicle</strong> with newer and<strong> Stronger Weapons</strong>. And make use of <strong>Artillery Strikes</strong>, for when your weapons alone just aren't enough to stop a <strong>Horde of Killer Robots</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/bafa2058a7cb0a56e81649a9775ad188.webp?t=1750927811\" width=600 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/5b528c0ac6b90fcf48bcd0c042f197e0.poster.avif?t=1750927811\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/5b528c0ac6b90fcf48bcd0c042f197e0.webm?t=1750927811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/5b528c0ac6b90fcf48bcd0c042f197e0.mp4?t=1750927811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in <strong>Unlocking High-Tech Equipment</strong> such as Lasers, Rail-Guns and Experimental Mechs. Or go all-in on Missile Barrages and Heavy Tanks.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/8c903b796e2640af355dacd9854879a9.webp?t=1750927811\" width=600 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/a271138310c69e25ed6c9316ace4441b.poster.avif?t=1750927811\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/a271138310c69e25ed6c9316ace4441b.webm?t=1750927811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/a271138310c69e25ed6c9316ace4441b.mp4?t=1750927811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against a <strong>Large Variety</strong> of <strong>Attacking Automatons</strong>. Each with their own unique strengths and weaknesses for you to exploit. Deal with <strong>Swarms</strong> of <strong>Detonating Drones</strong> using grenades. Or bring in the big guns to take down <strong>Menacing Machines</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/cda8d2d037c5af5bf3adb2fece318ce7.webp?t=1750927811\" width=600 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/0895f836400d9b2c3bc6c8cd2eb9f256.poster.avif?t=1750927811\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/0895f836400d9b2c3bc6c8cd2eb9f256.webm?t=1750927811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/0895f836400d9b2c3bc6c8cd2eb9f256.mp4?t=1750927811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy defensive <strong>Turrets</strong> to distract and damage your opponents! Or call in destructive <strong>Artillery Strikes</strong>! Using these abilities at the right time will be decisive in your fight against the <strong>Heinous Hordes</strong> of <strong>Killing Machines!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Control 30+ different vehicles. Including Mechs, Tanks and Cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Control 100+ types of weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Make use of powerful support abilities. Such as artillery strikes and deployable turrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defeat 3 different enemy sub-factions. Each with their own unique units and environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight across Planet-X with environments ranging from sand dunes to frozen wastelands and from forests to megacities  </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/8722320292869042981e2568e44c2709.webp?t=1750927811\" width=600 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/a81220112cd4fbbc1219f988efa9d164.poster.avif?t=1750927811\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/a81220112cd4fbbc1219f988efa9d164.webm?t=1750927811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/a81220112cd4fbbc1219f988efa9d164.mp4?t=1750927811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>Evil AI</strong> called <strong>HIVE</strong> has gained sentience and conquered Planet-X! Now it's up to you to <strong>FIGHT BACK</strong> using a large range of vehicles. From a small and quick <strong>Weaponized Delivery Truck</strong> all the way to building sized <strong>Heavy Mechs</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new Vehicles and Weapons</strong> by completing missions and fighting against the ever-increasing threat of hostile machines. <strong>Equip Your Vehicle</strong> with newer and<strong> Stronger Weapons</strong>. And make use of <strong>Artillery Strikes</strong>, for when your weapons alone just aren't enough to stop a <strong>Horde of Killer Robots</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/bafa2058a7cb0a56e81649a9775ad188.webp?t=1750927811\" width=600 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/5b528c0ac6b90fcf48bcd0c042f197e0.poster.avif?t=1750927811\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/5b528c0ac6b90fcf48bcd0c042f197e0.webm?t=1750927811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/5b528c0ac6b90fcf48bcd0c042f197e0.mp4?t=1750927811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in <strong>Unlocking High-Tech Equipment</strong> such as Lasers, Rail-Guns and Experimental Mechs. Or go all-in on Missile Barrages and Heavy Tanks.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/8c903b796e2640af355dacd9854879a9.webp?t=1750927811\" width=600 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/a271138310c69e25ed6c9316ace4441b.poster.avif?t=1750927811\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/a271138310c69e25ed6c9316ace4441b.webm?t=1750927811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/a271138310c69e25ed6c9316ace4441b.mp4?t=1750927811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against a <strong>Large Variety</strong> of <strong>Attacking Automatons</strong>. Each with their own unique strengths and weaknesses for you to exploit. Deal with <strong>Swarms</strong> of <strong>Detonating Drones</strong> using grenades. Or bring in the big guns to take down <strong>Menacing Machines</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/cda8d2d037c5af5bf3adb2fece318ce7.webp?t=1750927811\" width=600 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/0895f836400d9b2c3bc6c8cd2eb9f256.poster.avif?t=1750927811\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/0895f836400d9b2c3bc6c8cd2eb9f256.webm?t=1750927811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237920/extras/0895f836400d9b2c3bc6c8cd2eb9f256.mp4?t=1750927811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy defensive <strong>Turrets</strong> to distract and damage your opponents! Or call in destructive <strong>Artillery Strikes</strong>! Using these abilities at the right time will be decisive in your fight against the <strong>Heinous Hordes</strong> of <strong>Killing Machines!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Control 30+ different vehicles. Including Mechs, Tanks and Cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Control 100+ types of weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Make use of powerful support abilities. Such as artillery strikes and deployable turrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defeat 3 different enemy sub-factions. Each with their own unique units and environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight across Planet-X with environments ranging from sand dunes to frozen wastelands and from forests to megacities  </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Fight your way through the endless horde of robots! Control powerful mechs armed with a large variety of weapons, including: lasers, cluster bombs, and rocket launchers. Complete high-stakes missions, upgrade your arsenal, and climb the tech tree to save the world from the attacking automatons!",
